{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"250512505b490d17","name":"card_unit_t_34_85_1944","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Soviet/WinterWar/units/card_unit_t_34_85_1944","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"T-34-85 1944","text":"Has Blitz and Guard if you control 3 or more units.","flavorText":"The Soviet T-34-85, introduced in 1943, was an upgraded version of the highly successful Soviet T-34 medium tank. The \"85\" in its designation refers to the new 85mm gun installed in the turret, a substantial improvement over the earlier 76.2mm gun. This tank was a response to the need for increased firepower and improved performance against the more heavily armored German tanks encountered on the Eastern Front. The T-34-85 boasted better anti-tank capabilities and increased accuracy, allowing it to effectively combat the newer German tanks, such as the Panther and Tiger. The T-34-85 had a more powerful engine, providing greater speed and mobility compared to its predecessors. It also featured a more spacious three-man turret, improving the crew's working conditions and the tank's overall efficiency. This model was an essential part of the Soviet armored forces in the later stages of the war and was known for its reliability, ease of production, and combat effectiveness. The T-34-85 model of 1943 set the standard appearance for the series until 1945. However, the 1944 version came with a simpler ZiS-S-53 85mm gun, radio moved from the hull into a turret with improved layout and new gunner's sights.","faction":"Soviet","type":"tank","rarity":"Rare","cost":8,"operationCost":2,"attack":7,"defense":7},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"GameplayTags":["subtype.t34"],"Name":"card_unit_t_34_85_1944","title":{"Namespace":"card_soviet","Key":"card_unit_t_34_85_1944_title","SourceString":"T-34-85 1944","LocalizedString":"T-34-85 1944"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::tank","attack":7,"defense":7,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Soviet","kredits":8,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_s